	&quot;Legally, I&apos;m not allowed to sell firearms&quot;,
	&quot;Something something VIP shirt&quot;,
	&quot;Juice!&quot;,
	&quot;I already killed the Epik Duck with the shotgun over there&quot;,
	&quot;I don&apos;t know why my face is like this. Please help.&quot;,
	&quot;Imagine if in the future they replace BC tiers with a singular one...&quot;,
	&quot;I probably wouldn&apos;t last long in there&quot;,
	&quot;I remember when you got 10 robux daily in 2007...&quot;,
	&quot;I sure do hope the next egg hunt isn&apos;t catered towards BCers!&quot;,
	&quot;My torso is anchored I can&apos;t move&quot;,
	&quot;I don&apos;t know the Points to Robux conversion so IDK if I&apos;m making bank&quot;,
	&quot;This place would have badges... except that&apos;s a BCer thing&quot;,
	&quot;If you have a spare medkit, please share, I&apos;m thirsty&quot;
}

while true do
	script.Parent.Name = &quot;NBCer: &quot;..sayings[math.random(1,#sayings)]
	wait(4)
end
