	&quot;get on mi lvl nub&quot;,
	&quot;u can&apos;t run nub&quot;,
	&quot;u r stuped becaus u don&apos;t hav bc&quot;,
	&quot;GET OFF DIS SERVER NUB&quot;,
	&quot;u r gunna die lolz&quot;,
	&quot;ur funni&quot;,
	&quot;Telamon iz epik&quot;,
